    "The Rust FFI declarations match abi/omega_gpu.manifest. Check: cargo test -p aien-omega-gpu --test abi_manifest -- --exact rust_ffi_matches_the_manifest"
  ],
  "name": "aien-omega-gpu",
  "purpose": "FFI to the native (no CUDA) Omega GPU matmul engine, pinned by omega.lock",
  "schema_version": "1.0.0"
}
